    },
    "The terminal has changed. Check its latest state" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端里已有变化，请看最新状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal is laid out at phone size, and shrinks on the desktop while you look. Long-press to select and copy; drag to see history. Use the keyboard button or the key bar to type." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端按手机尺寸排版，查看期间桌面上的终端会变小；长按可选取文字复制，拖动查看历史。点键盘按钮或用按键栏输入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The terminal is laid out at phone width; full-screen programs show as on the desktop and can be pinched to zoom. Long-press to select and copy; drag to see history. Type commands below, or use the key bar." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "终端画面按手机宽度排版，全屏程序按桌面原样显示、可双指缩放；长按可选取文字复制，拖动查看历史。可在下方输入命令，或用按键栏按键。"
          }
        }
      }
